                            10
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَنْشَقَ الرِّيحَ</span></b> 
                         (assumed tropical:)  [<i>He snuffed the wind</i>]:
(TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مخر</span>:) <i>he snuffed, scented,</i> or <i>smelt,
the wind;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَشَّقَهَا</span></b> . (Msb.) See 10 in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شم</span>.

